> This is my first message to this list. I currently have 5 DS20
> alphaservers running alpha linux, and am quite unhappy with it because of
> memory leakage, stateful netfilter problems and many unaligned traps...
> So I am thinking of taking up FreeBSD on my servers to see how it works.
> The problem is that I am now having problems with installing it on
> the DS20s ...
