I agree with David also. I believe we should unify the kernel support 
as much as possible. This will be more important as other 
architectures (sparc64, ia64, ppc) need kernel debugging and the 
smaller the diffs, the easier the port.

I might have some time later to take a look into this and cobble 
something together. I'll let you know.

Mark

